:"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-25T01:42:06-07:00","id":1211324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>korekore</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210977-2e-craftsman-needs-no-tools-as-an-artifact?p=1211013#post1211013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2nd ed and I am aware of those but they don't expedite as much or in the same way as craftsmen needs no tools</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> well, DBs aren't supposed to be as speedy solo-crafters as Solars<br /> <br /> but then DBs can instead call upon an army of skilled craftsmen to help out. An essence 3 solar might craft at x12 speed for a single person - but as single Essence 3 DB can call upon 50 craftsmen to assist in making something. That makes for very speed production just the same","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-25T02:31:52-07:00","id":1211334,"title":"","content":"Instead of an artifact, give them followers, allies, resources.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-25T05:48:24-07:00","id":1211378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210977-2e-craftsman-needs-no-tools-as-an-artifact?p=1211281#post1211281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Do you want the tools part, or just the speed up part?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Speed Up part. While the Craftsman has been able to gain assistance up to this point in the story (admittedly that is only going to get him about 3 extra successes on an artifact project he cares for) the party is going to be forced to leave behind a lot of those resources as the story nears the empresses purge. Aside from a Celestial craftsman ally which his character would not accept as he is a staunch immaculate I do not see that being as helpful. He does have plenty of resources but thats just raw components.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1166-korekore","name":"korekore","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1166_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-25T07:33:41-07:00","id":1211404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>korekore</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210977-2e-craftsman-needs-no-tools-as-an-artifact?p=1211378#post1211378\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Speed Up part. While the Craftsman has been able to gain assistance up to this point in the story (admittedly that is only going to get him about 3 extra successes on an artifact project he cares for) the party is going to be forced to leave behind a lot of those resources as the story nears the empresses purge. Aside from a Celestial craftsman ally which his character would not accept as he is a staunch immaculate I do not see that being as helpful. He does have plenty of resources but thats just raw components.</div> </div> </div> </div>If that's so, just lower it to around artifact 3 or 2. Craftsmen needs no tools, in addition to the speed up also grants you an entire workshop you don't need to carry around. I assure you that if you suddenly remove that power, you can bump down the artifact rating by at least a level.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}